---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<section class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-sage/10">
  <div class="max-w-content mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-tight">Once You Know Where the Leaks Are, Here's How We Fix Them</h2>
      <p class="mt-5 text-base sm:text-lg text-charcoal/75 leading-relaxed">
        Simple systems, working together, so no enquiry and no returning client falls through the cracks.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 sm:gap-8">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-card hover:shadow-card-hover transition-shadow">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-olive/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
          <Icon name="unlock" class="w-6 h-6 text-olive" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Frictionless Booking</h3>
        <p class="text-charcoal/70 leading-relaxed text-[18px]">No logins, no long forms. Clients book in a couple of taps right from WhatsApp/Telegram, so they don't give up halfway through.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-card hover:shadow-card-hover transition-shadow">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-olive/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
          <Icon name="zap" class="w-6 h-6 text-olive" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Instant Lead Response</h3>
        <p class="text-charcoal/70 leading-relaxed text-[18px]">Every enquiry gets an immediate response, day or night, without you needing a human glued to the phone.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-card hover:shadow-card-hover transition-shadow">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-olive/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
          <Icon name="calendar-clock" class="w-6 h-6 text-olive" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Automatic Re-booking</h3>
        <p class="text-charcoal/70 leading-relaxed text-[18px]">We track when clients are due back and reach out at the right time, so appointments (and revenue) don't get forgotten.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-card hover:shadow-card-hover transition-shadow">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-olive/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
          <Icon name="plug" class="w-6 h-6 text-olive" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Works With What You Already Use</h3>
        <p class="text-charcoal/70 leading-relaxed text-[18px]">Keep your existing CRM or booking software. Bella Technologies plugs into your current systems. No migration, no disruption.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
